{"config":{"lang":["vi"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Home","text":"<p>N\u01a1i t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng s\u1edd ch\u1ea1m qua.</p>"},{"location":"#about-me","title":"About Me","text":"<p>\u00af\\__( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0)_/\u00af </p> <p>(\u25c9\u0398\u25c9)( \u25cd\u2022\u3266\u2022\u25cd )( \u24db \u03c9 \u24db *)</p>"},{"location":"tags/","title":"Tags","text":"<p>My tags</p>"},{"location":"tags/#tag:japanese","title":"Japanese","text":"<ul> <li>            B\u1ea3ng hiragana &amp; katakana          </li> </ul>"},{"location":"angular/","title":"T\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c Angular","text":"<p>N\u01a1i t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c Angular t\u1eeb c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn n\u00e2ng cao.</p>"},{"location":"angular/001/","title":"B\u00e0i 1: N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/","title":"AWS Identity &amp; Access Management (IAM)","text":"<p>IAM l\u00e0 trung t\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n an ninh c\u1ee7a AWS. N\u00f3 cho ph\u00e9p qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd ai c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp (x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c) v\u00e0 h\u1ecd c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n l\u00e0m g\u00ec (ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n) \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean tr\u00ean AWS.</p>"},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#root-user","title":"Root User","text":"<p>\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 \"si\u00eau t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\" \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra ngay khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n AWS b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email.</p> <p>Quy\u1ec1n h\u1ea1n: C\u00f3 to\u00e0n quy\u1ec1n tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u00e0 c\u1ea3 th\u00f4ng tin thanh to\u00e1n (billing). Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n b\u1edfi b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 Policy n\u00e0o.</p> <p>Khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt: Ch\u1ec9 n\u00ean d\u00f9ng Root User \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o IAM User \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, sau \u0111\u00f3 \"kh\u00f3a\" n\u00f3 l\u1ea1i. Lu\u00f4n lu\u00f4n ph\u1ea3i b\u1eadt MFA (X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c \u0111a l\u1edbp) cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n n\u00e0y.</p>"},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#iam-user","title":"IAM User","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#iam-policy","title":"IAM Policy","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#inline-policy-vs-custom-policy","title":"Inline Policy vs Custom Policy","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#iam-group","title":"IAM Group","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#multi-iam-group","title":"Multi IAM Group","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#deny-effect","title":"DENY effect","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#iam-role","title":"IAM Role","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#restricted-user-in-role-trust-relationship","title":"Restricted User in role Trust Relationship","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#configure-multiple-user-in-role-trust-relationship","title":"Configure multiple user in Role Trust Relationship","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#principle-vs-identity","title":"Principle vs Identity","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#iam-permssion-validation-order","title":"IAM Permssion Validation Order","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#permission-boundary","title":"Permission Boundary","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#iam-components-relationship","title":"IAM Components Relationship","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#configure-aws-cli","title":"Configure AWS CLI","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#enabling-billing-info-for-iam-user-and-role","title":"Enabling Billing info for IAM User and Role","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-identity-access-management/#multi-section-on-aws-management-console","title":"Multi-Section on AWS Management Console","text":""},{"location":"aws/aws-la-gi/","title":"T\u1ed5ng quan v\u1ec1 AWS Cloud","text":""},{"location":"aws/network-basic/","title":"Network Basic","text":""},{"location":"aws/network-basic/#amazon-vpccomponents","title":"Amazon VPC'Components","text":"Text Only<pre><code>1. subnets\n2. internet gateway\n3. route table\n4. network acess control list\n    network acl\n    NACL\n5. security group\n6. NAT gateway.\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"aws/network-basic/#create-your-first-vpc","title":"Create your first VPC","text":""},{"location":"aws/network-basic/#create-public-subnet","title":"Create public subnet","text":""},{"location":"aws/exam-test/exam-01/","title":"Exam 01","text":""},{"location":"aws/exam-test/exam-01/#q-45","title":"Q 45:","text":"<p>A logistics company is building a multi-tier application to track the location of its trucks during peak operating hours. The company wants these data points to be accessible in real-time in its analytics platform via a REST API. The company has hired you as an AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate to build a multi-tier solution to store and retrieve this location data for analysis.</p> <p>Which of the following options addresses the given use case?</p> <ol> <li>[ ] Leverage Amazon API Gateway with Amazon Kinesis Data Analytics</li> <li>[ ] Leverage Amazon API Gateway with AWS Lambda</li> <li>[ ] Leverage Amazon Athena with Amazon S3</li> <li>[ ] Leverage Amazon QuickSight with Amazon Redshift</li> </ol>"},{"location":"blog/","title":"Blogs","text":""},{"location":"japanese/","title":"C\u00f9ng nhau h\u1ecdc ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt","text":""},{"location":"japanese/beginer/bang-chu-cai-hiragana-katakana/","title":"B\u1ea3ng ch\u1eef c\u00e1i Hiragana &amp; Katakana","text":"<p>| \u3042\u3000|\u3000\u3044\u3000\uff5c\u3000\u3046\u3000|\u3000\u3048\u3000|\u3000\u304a\u3000|</p> <p>| \u3042\u3000|\u3000\u3044\u3000\uff5c\u3000\u3046\u3000|\u3000\u3048\u3000|\u3000\u304a\u3000|</p> <p>| \u3042\u3000|\u3000\u3044\u3000\uff5c\u3000\u3046\u3000|\u3000\u3048\u3000|\u3000\u304a\u3000|</p> <p>| \u3042\u3000|\u3000\u3044\u3000\uff5c\u3000\u3046\u3000|\u3000\u3048\u3000|\u3000\u304a\u3000|</p> <p>| \u3042\u3000|\u3000\u3044\u3000\uff5c\u3000\u3046\u3000|\u3000\u3048\u3000|\u3000\u304a\u3000|</p>","tags":["Japanese"]}]}